      "step": "Step 1: Row-major layout: arr[i][j] address = Base + (i * cols + j) * sizeof(elem).\nStep 2: Stride of 1 element loads consecutive cache lines (Spatial Locality).\nStep 3: Column-major stride = 14 * sizeof(elem), jumping across memory pages and causing TLB misses.\nStep 4: Speedup can exceed 10x-20x for large N.",
