      "step": "Step 1: low = 1,500,000,000; high = 1,800,000,000.\nStep 2: low + high = 3,300,000,000 > 2,147,483,647 (INT_MAX).\nStep 3: Overflow wraps to negative value: mid becomes negative.\nStep 4: Safe formula: high - low = 300,000,000; (high - low)/2 = 150,000,000; low + 150M = 1,650,000,000.",
      "tech": "Signed integer overflow prevention.",
      "formula": "\\text{mid} = \\text{low} + \\left\\lfloor \\frac{\\text{high} - \\text{low}}{2} \\right\\rfloor",
      "code": "// Vulnerable:\nint mid = (low + high) / 2;\n// Safe:\nint mid = low + (high - low) / 2;"
