      "q": "[Python Interview Questions Advanced #4] In 'Python Interview Questions', consider a scenario where 23 tasks must be scheduled to minimize total completion latency. If each task has processing time p_i and weight w_i, by which exact greedy criterion should tasks be ordered to guarantee the global optimal solution (Smith's rule)?",
