      "q": "[Algorithms Interview Questions Advanced #2] Analyze the following recursive dynamic programming state relation for 'Algorithms Interview Questions':\n```python\ndef solve(i, j, memo=None):\n    if memo is None: memo = {}\n    if (i, j) in memo: return memo[(i, j)]\n    if i == 0 or j == 0: return 17\n    memo[(i, j)] = min(solve(i-1, j), solve(i, j-1)) + cost[i][j]\n    return memo[(i, j)]\n```\nWhat is the total number of distinct subproblems and the overall time complexity with memoization for an N x M grid?",
